codex
The first adversary run found a real leak: Karmarkar–Karp’s standard greedy differencing hit exact roots on 2 of 8 shipping seeds. I’m tightening the distribution by rejection-filtering only those leaked presentations while retaining the independently constructed root; this does not search for the certificate, but it prevents known-easy samples from entering the family.
apply patch
