-`verify(inst, inst["answer"])` returns `(True, "ok")`. Replacing `x_1` by `2/1` returns `(False, "quadratic equation F_1 is nonzero")`. A person can solve this demo on paper: magnitudes with the same last digit form two four-element groups, and each group contains two pairs with the same sum.
